@startuml UML组件图-实现修订
' 多人共享记账系统 —— 实验三实现后的分层组件图
' 与实验二组件图的差异：实现按"轻量级 Windows 桌面"收敛为单进程四层，
' 取消 API 网关与独立服务进程，但保留「权限集中校验」与「日志只追加」两条约束。
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 45
top to bottom direction

package "表现层（PySide6 单进程）" as PL {
  [界面\n登录 · 记录 · 审核\n统计 · 结算 · 成员 · 日志] as UI
}

package "应用服务层" as SVC {
  [认证服务\nAuthService] as S_AUTH
  [账本与成员\nLedgerService] as S_LEDGER
  [记录服务\nRecordService] as S_RECORD
  [审核与更正\nReviewService] as S_REVIEW
  [统计服务\nStatsService] as S_STATS
  [结算服务\nSettlementService] as S_SETTLE
  [日志服务\nLogService] as S_LOG
  [幂等执行器\nIdempotencyExecutor] as S_IDEM
}

package "领域层（不依赖数据库与界面）" as DOMAIN {
  [权限矩阵\npermissions] as D_PERM
  [记录状态机\nstate_machine] as D_SM
  [校验与金额\nvalidation · money] as D_VAL
}

package "数据访问层" as DAL {
  [Database\n连接 · 事务 · 保存点] as D_DB
  [仓储\nRepositories] as D_REPO
  [建表 SQL\nschema] as D_SCHEMA
}

database "SQLite 单文件库\n账本 / 记录 / 结算 / 日志 / 幂等键" as DB

UI --> S_AUTH
UI --> S_LEDGER
UI --> S_RECORD
UI --> S_REVIEW
UI --> S_STATS
UI --> S_SETTLE
UI --> S_LOG

S_RECORD --> S_IDEM : 新增 / 更正幂等
S_REVIEW --> S_IDEM

S_AUTH --> D_REPO
S_LEDGER --> D_REPO
S_RECORD --> D_REPO
S_REVIEW --> D_REPO
S_STATS --> D_REPO
S_SETTLE --> D_REPO
S_LOG --> D_REPO

S_LEDGER ..> D_PERM : 权限判定
S_RECORD ..> D_PERM
S_REVIEW ..> D_PERM
S_SETTLE ..> D_PERM
S_RECORD ..> D_SM : 状态迁移
S_REVIEW ..> D_SM
S_RECORD ..> D_VAL : 金额与字段校验
S_REVIEW ..> D_VAL

D_REPO --> D_DB
D_DB --> D_SCHEMA : 首次建表
D_DB --> DB : 读写

note right of S_IDEM
  同一幂等键的重复提交只返回首次结果，
  不新增业务记录与操作日志（REQ-016）
end note

note bottom of D_REPO
  越权日志写在独立事务中，
  业务回滚不会带走日志（REQ-018、REQ-020）
end note

@enduml
